35,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The post-occupancy reviews show high ratings where any department could book the space.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"The booking data confirms specialist rooms are idle, but general rooms are always full.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,George,,The technicians are spending hours on manual checks because the equipment is outdated.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,The site diaries show six weeks lost to weather on exposed work.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Tender records show mechanical plant costs rising by a fifth, while surfacing held steady.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Mizuki, does the delivery schedule data support your weather concerns?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@George, does the staffing data show a lack of relief for the technicians?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,George,,"Yes, front-of-house posts are unfilled, but technicians have spare hours.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Yes, works argued for comfort slipped a year or more, unlike inspection fixes.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"The renewal reserve for audiovisual kit was never opened, despite the write-down.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The timetable records show every closed room required hired off-site space.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,This confirms that space decisions ignore the timetable impact and usage patterns.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,George,,The manual routines are a symptom of the lack of investment in proper equipment.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,The calendar slips are predictable if we look at the rationale for the projects.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"The market costs for plant are rising, but we are not budgeting for the post-opening costs.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"We should prioritize projects that have broad, bookable access based on the reviews.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Victoria,,Agreed. The data shows general-purpose space is in high demand and currently underserved.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,George,,"I worry about the maintenance burden, but the current staff are underutilized in other areas.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,"If we choose a project with a clear rationale, we might avoid the schedule slips.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,We must ensure the budget accounts for the rising cost of mechanical systems if we choose that.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
